    <mxCell id="knote" parent="1" vertex="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=10;" value="Three brokers, not one: default.replication.factor=3 with min.insync.replicas=2. A single-broker stack silently downgrades acks=all to a guarantee the platform does not have. Auto topic creation is off; partition counts come from topics.tsv.">
